<title>USA: Nac Re expands share buyback program.</title>
<headline>Nac Re expands share buyback program.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>NAC Re Corp said on Tuesday it has expanded its stock repurchase program by one million shares.</p>
<p>The company said it has repurchased approximately three million shares of its common stock since the inception of the program in 1988, including approximately one million shares in 1996.</p>
</text>
